# We are celebrating XMAS and the New Year with special little offer for 2014...

We have 4 NEW  beautiful handmade drums (by us) and we would like to give 4 special people the opportunity to purchase one of these drums and receive a FREE 5 week course voucher to use in 2014. This offer is valid until January 27th and the voucher must be used for all courses starting in January in either Maroochydore, Palmwoods or Maleny locations.
